  "goodToKnow": "Die Bewegungsfreiheit is freedom of movement, physically (Die Jacke bietet viel Bewegungsfreiheit) or politically (die Bewegungsfreiheit einschränken), and figuratively room to manoeuvre: finanzielle Bewegungsfreiheit. In legal language, freedom to move and settle is usually die Freizügigkeit. During the pandemic, lockdowns limited Bewegungsfreiheit in many countries. It has no plural."
